Package: lab5
Title: Fetch and Explore Qeustions from the Open Trivia Database
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jonas", "Hautamäki Bengtsson", , "jonha849@student.liu.se", 
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to query the Open Trivia Database API,
  handling session tokens, decoding and the API's rate limit, and returns the 
  questions as a data frame. Includes a Shiny app for interactively exploring 
  the questions.
